                </opener>
                <p>I hereby certify the within to be a true copy of the original, on file in this
                    office. Given under my hand and seal this 18th day of October, 1892.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">John T. Dare</hi>, <lb/>
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Deputy Collector.</hi></signed></closer>
